  "goodToKnow": "Gemeinnützig means non-profit or charitable, a legal status granted by the tax office: ein gemeinnütziger Verein, eine gemeinnützige GmbH (gGmbH). Donations to such bodies are tax-deductible, and you get a Spendenquittung (donation receipt). Die Gemeinnützigkeit can be withdrawn, as in the 2019 case of the anti-globalisation network Attac, which sparked debate about political activity by charities. Related: das Gemeinwohl (common good)."
